# VER: home of ver#V, but declares a versioned ontology IRI (.../ver/1.0) that
# differs from the term namespace: found through the dereferenced document.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://ex.org/ver/1.0> a owl:Ontology .
<http://ex.org/ver#V> a owl:Class ; rdfs:label "V"@en .
